      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "5. A: Zuìhòu yìbān chē shi           What time is the last bus?\n      jǐdiǎn zhōng?\n   B: Shíyīdiǎn shífēn.               Eleven-ten.\n\nNote on No. 5\n\nZuìhòu yìbān chē: Zuì is the word for \"most,\" or \"-est.\" Zuìhòu means \"latest,\" or \"last.\" Note the order in which the elements of this phrase appear:\n\nzuìhòu  |  yì-  |  -bān  |  chē\n\nBoth the number and the counter are required in this phrase.\n\nCompare:\n\ntóu yì-  -bān chē                \"the first bus\"\nxià yì-  -bān chē                \"the next bus\"\nshàng yì-  -bān chē              \"the last (previous) bus\"\n"
    }
